cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this anthology, cite the document you used by its title and
  version. The version is the unit the corpus cites by, and each document
  carries its own (see CHANGELOG.md). The entry below is for the collection.
title: "Derivation of Value"
abstract: >-
  A working program in mechanism design and the philosophy of value, published
  as an open anthology: five volumes, a framework, a whitepaper, and technical
  papers that close, or fail to close, the problems the volumes leave open.
